 "structural_change": "S81-TOPK FAN32 (after s81dvbk_sq_succ gate CTS rc137 = 14400 s gate-stall kill in post-CTS repair_timing, 507 setup endpoints, weighted GPL congestion 1.33 on 40% of tiles, and succb TT/FF spread 158.6/138.1): OT_S81PH_SEL_FAN32 replaces every >256-load control net in the native selector slice with KEPT identical copies on the same edge (exact, 0 cycles): histogram clear (2820) and update enable v2 (2112) -> 128 copies x 22 bin flops; group selects r_cg/r_fg (2816) -> 16 copies each + decoded constant-index one-hot AND-OR (no runtime part-select); packer rotate shift amounts qf/sh (1600/1413) -> one copy per lane (RE=50 selects). Clock: H-tree no longer detours around the two abutted SRAM stacks (s81 gather leaf 10-14 recipe). Geometry = s81dvbk_sq_succ (unchanged macro lattice/pins/band) + all successor fixes.",
